+ * The suspend PCM firmware, pcm_suspend_20150805_V1, byte for byte the
+ * suspend_binary_ca7[] array in the vendor's GPL-2.0 mt_spm_sleep.c
+ * (drivers/misc/mediatek/base/power/mt8173/, Copyright (C) 2016 MediaTek Inc.).
+ * It is sequencer microcode for which no assembler source is available.
+ */
